.TH "ADVERTISE COMMAND"
The advertise command allows you to place advertisements in the
Fast Food Journal.
This service is very inexpensive.
.s3
An example:
.NF
[16h] ::: advertise
Our rates are $20 a line.  Type your copy, end with ^D.
 > Unless someone offers to sell me 4 shares of Doggy Diner by 11:30 (a.m.)
 > I will merge D.D. into Wretched Waffles (there's no more stock in either).
 > (EOF)
2 lines ... $40.00
[15h] ::: journal
	~~~~~ Fast Food Journal ~~~~~
Fri May  7 12:20 Caliban gave Slab Inc. 13 shares of Nasty and Tasty Foods
Fri May  7 12:24 Caliban gave Slab Inc. 8 shares of Gastrointestinals'
Sun May  9 18:33 Slab Inc. becomes `Freddy'
Sun May  9 18:57 Freddy gave Caliban $3900.00
Sun May  9 19:57 -------- From Dr. Death (advertisement) --------
   Unless someone offers to sell me 4 shares of Doggy Diner by 11:30 (a.m.)
   I will merge D.D. into Wretched Waffles (there's no more stock in either).
.FI
Advertisements can be fairly long (given you have the necessary money)
and are usually used to offer stock for sale or to solicit a stock offer.
.s3
See also: journal
